# We are under water, inside one vast, slow creature: a jellyf — the developer's layout, as fixtures
world We are under water, inside one vast, slow creature: a jellyf
  seed 1
  size 40
  terrain relief 0 roughness 0
  ground water weight 1
  fixture column rising bubble column size 5x21.1x5 material water porous 1 at 0,0
  fixture pod_week01 pod membrane size 5.4x5.4x5.4 material water porous 1 at 2.91,7.99
  fixture pod_final the bell of the jellyfish size 11.2x7.28x11.2 material water porous 1 at 0,0
  fixture attractor_week01 strange attractor (lorenz) size 1.9x1.9x1.9 material water porous 1 at 2.91,7.99
  fixture bell_voice_1 strange attractor (halvorsen) size 1.7x1.7x1.7 material water porous 1 at -2.6,-0.3
  fixture bell_voice_2 strange attractor (rossler) size 1.7x1.7x1.7 material water porous 1 at 0,-0.3
  fixture bell_voice_3 strange attractor (dadras) size 1.7x1.7x1.7 material water porous 1 at 2.6,-0.3
  weather rain 0 wind 0.2 fog 0
  time 10:00 season summer temp 18

level_reference 70
gen water_pressure
    prompt submerged slow water current, broad low fluid pressure surges with smooth upper harmonics, irregular continuous flow, no impacts, seamless ambience loop, consistent texture
    duration 30
    loopable

gen pod_singing
    prompt sustained wordless singing tone, rounded vowel, two closely detuned pitches beating slowly and irregularly, gentle organic pitch modulation, smooth continuous delivery, dry, seamless ambience loop, consistent texture
    duration 30
    loopable

gen bell_singing
    prompt sustained wordless alto singing on D, rounded vowel with warm harmonic overtones, slow irregular organic modulation, no syllables or attacks, dry, seamless ambience loop, consistent texture
    duration 30
    loopable

2 * loop water_pressure
    source_id deep_water_pressure
    bed
    zone water
    move static
    spl 48
    volume follow depth 0to1 1to0.7
    pitch follow depth 0to1 0.65to1.05
    reverb wet 0.5 size 1 damping 0.9
    filter lowpass cutoff follow depth 0to1 320to1100
    visual none
    randomstart

loop whale-song-underwater every 160to260
    source_id remote_call
    radius 15
    zone water
    place 0 12 -260
    move static
    spl 100
    start 100
    duration 16
    reverb wet 0.4 size 1 damping 0.95
    filter lowpass cutoff 550
    visual sphere

loop gen continuous rising stream of small underwater bubbles, rounded liquid gurgles with irregular overlapping releases, gentle flow without sharp pops, close dry recording, seamless ambience loop, consistent texture
    source_id column_bubbles
    line
    radius 0.65
    zone water
    at column
    spl 55
    reverb wet 0.35 size 0.9 damping 0.9
    filter lowpass cutoff 1200
    visual sphere

loop pod_singing
    source_id week01_singing
    zone water
    persistent
    radius 1.2
    at attractor_week01
    spl 76
    reverb wet 0.4 size 0.95 damping 0.9
    filter lowpass cutoff follow distance 3to12 2200to550
    visual sphere

oneshot gen small cluster of bubbles released into water, rounded liquid burbles gently dwindling, close dry recording every 18to35
    source_id week01_bubbles
    radius 0.4
    zone water
    at attractor_week01
    spl 43
    start 12
    cooldown 12
    reverb wet 0.4 size 0.9 damping 0.9
    filter lowpass cutoff 1100
    variants 3
    visual sphere

3 * loop bell_singing
    source_id bell_singers
    zone water
    persistent
    randomstart
    radius 2
    at bell_voice
    spl 73
    pitch 1to1.5
    reverb wet 0.55 size 1 damping 0.9
    filter lowpass cutoff follow distance 3to22 2200to650
    visual sphere

loop gen water flowing smoothly around a submerged swimming body, gentle irregular fluid rush without splashes or strokes, close dry recording, seamless ambience loop, consistent texture
    source_id swimming_water
    zone water
    attach listener
    spl 44
    volume follow speed 0to2 0to1
    reverb wet 0.35 size 0.65 damping 0.95
    filter lowpass cutoff 850
    visual none

on pod_enter gen single smooth liquid membrane deformation, rounded low tonal swell rising gently, no impact, close dry recording
    source_id membrane_enter
    radius 2
    spl 55
    cooldown 1.5
    within 5
    reverb wet 0.55 size 0.9 damping 0.9
    filter lowpass cutoff 1400
    variants 3
    visual sphere

on pod_leave gen single smooth liquid membrane deformation, rounded low tonal swell falling gently and releasing, no impact, close dry recording
    source_id membrane_leave
    radius 2
    spl 53
    cooldown 1.5
    within 5
    reverb wet 0.55 size 0.9 damping 0.9
    filter lowpass cutoff 1200
    variants 3
    visual sphere

on page_open gen single submerged bronze bell struck gently with a padded mallet, rounded low fundamental and sustained harmonic decay, no sharp attack, close dry recording
    source_id page_open_bell
    zone reading strict
    attach listener
    spl 51
    cooldown 1
    within 2
    reverb wet 0.65 size 1 damping 0.93
    filter lowpass cutoff 1000
    variants 3
    visual none

on page_close gen single small release of underwater bubbles, rounded liquid burble dwindling smoothly, close dry recording
    source_id page_close_bubbles
    attach listener
    spl 44
    cooldown 0.6
    within 2
    reverb wet 0.4 size 0.8 damping 0.9
    filter lowpass cutoff 1100
    variants 3
    visual none

on ui_hover gen single tiny underwater bubble blip, rounded low liquid resonance, close dry recording
    source_id hover_bubble
    attach listener
    spl 29
    cooldown 0.2
    within 2
    reverb wet 0.15 size 0.5 damping 0.95
    filter lowpass cutoff 850
    variants 3
    visual none

on ui_press gen single small underwater bubble blup, rounded liquid resonance with a gently descending pitch, close dry recording
    source_id press_bubble
    attach listener
    spl 33
    cooldown 0.25
    within 2
    reverb wet 0.2 size 0.6 damping 0.95
    filter lowpass cutoff 950
    variants 3
    visual none